cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this dataset version when reporting results."
type: dataset
title: "World Legal Bench: Native-Language Legal Reasoning Across Twelve Jurisdictions"
version: "1.4.1-release"
date-released: 2026-11-23
authors:
  - name: "World Legal Bench contributors"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A difficulty-selected, source-linked benchmark of constitutional and public-law
  reasoning with jurisdiction-specific test languages and country-balanced scoring.
  The release includes frozen questions, reference answers, selection provenance,
  and a standalone evaluation toolkit.
keywords:
  - legal reasoning
  - multilingual evaluation
  - constitutional law
  - public law
  - large language models
